--- !u!114 &11400110
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  nodeId: guide_welcome_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "마을 밖 세 갈래가 끝마다 다시 마을로 이어져. 지도에 적힌 세 사람이 각 길목에 남아 있고."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_welcome_2
  trueNextNodeId:
  falseNextNodeId:
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400111
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_2
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: Protagonist
  dialogueText: "그 사람들을 만나 보면 길이 막힌 까닭도 알 수 있겠네."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_welcome_3
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 900, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400112
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "그래. 먼저 누구를 찾아갈지는 네가 정해. 셋이 자리를 뜨면 겹쳐 보이던 길도 모습을 드러낼 거야."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_end
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 1180, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400120
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "미아의 리본이 전과 같은 풀숲에 있었어. 그런데 미아만 그걸 처음 겪은 얼굴이더라."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_2
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 260}
